    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels so heavy though. like, \"drifting\" sounds okay but there's nothing to drift towards. i look in the mirror and i don't recognize the person looking back. it's like the soul part of me just died when they left and now i'm just this hollow shell performing the motions of living. i don't see the point in trying to \"find\" anything when there's nothing left to find.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
